WEBVTT

00:00:01.040 --> 00:00:05.010
<b>Goddess Search, Day 6</b>

00:00:07.350 --> 00:00:09.380
<i>My name is Shiori Shiomiya.</i>

00:00:09.380 --> 00:00:15.300
<i>Currently, I am possessed by some 
immense, unknown beast.</i>

00:00:13.170 --> 00:00:15.730
<b>Beast</b>

00:00:15.950 --> 00:00:20.570
<i>This eerie feeling has constant 
control over my entire being,</i>

00:00:20.570 --> 00:00:23.340
<i>leaving me no time to relax.</i>

00:00:24.370 --> 00:00:25.540
Shiori...

00:00:25.960 --> 00:00:29.550
Have you finished your novel 
for the Mai High Festival?

00:00:29.550 --> 00:00:31.640
I-I need a little more time.

00:00:31.640 --> 00:00:33.470
You've been saying that for a while.

00:00:33.470 --> 00:00:35.510
If it's not done first thing, day after tomorrow,

00:00:35.510 --> 00:00:37.520
we won't be able to use it for the festival.

00:00:38.260 --> 00:00:43.540
<b>Shiori</b>

00:00:39.040 --> 00:00:43.540
<i>I have come to realize this beast's identity.</i>

00:00:43.540 --> 00:00:47.270
<i>It's the emotion generally known a-as</i>

00:00:47.560 --> 00:00:50.820
<b>Love</b>

00:00:47.990 --> 00:00:50.820
<i>love...</i>

00:00:51.690 --> 00:00:53.320
<i>I think...</i>

00:00:54.310 --> 00:00:56.630
<i>In books, love is sometime depicted as sweet,</i>

00:00:56.630 --> 00:01:00.330
<i>sometimes as beautiful, and sometimes as sad.</i>

00:01:01.450 --> 00:01:04.830
<i>But none of those descriptions 
apply to these emotions!</i>

00:01:05.850 --> 00:01:08.630
<i>The person who has invaded my novel...</i>

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:11.800
<i>The person in another man's embrace...</i>

00:01:12.460 --> 00:01:14.970
<i>The person who was cross-dressing 
and laughing like a maniac...</i>

00:01:15.490 --> 00:01:19.960
<i>And the one who saved me after I 
locked myself in the library...</i>

00:01:20.360 --> 00:01:22.560
<i>Were they all the same person?</i>

00:01:23.490 --> 00:01:26.680
<i>If so, it's too unfair...</i>

00:01:27.300 --> 00:01:30.190
<i>The first male with whom I had a 
romantic encounter had to be...</i>

00:01:30.310 --> 00:01:31.070
<i>A pervert!</i>

00:01:31.190 --> 00:01:31.940
<i>A freak!</i>

00:01:32.410 --> 00:01:34.240
<i>A cross-dresser!</i>

00:01:34.240 --> 00:01:36.020
<i>What am I supposed to do?!</i>

00:01:39.490 --> 00:01:44.830
<i>And the worst part is that he 
doesn't keep his promises.</i>

00:01:45.750 --> 00:01:48.950
<i>He said he'd come to read the rest of my novel...</i>

00:01:49.400 --> 00:01:51.880
<i>Yesterday, I waited for him 
all day, but he never came.</i>

00:01:52.620 --> 00:01:55.380
<i>A man who's simply a 
perverted freak is one thing,</i>

00:01:55.380 --> 00:01:59.530
<i>but there's no hope for a perverted 
freak who can't keep promises.</i>

00:02:01.940 --> 00:02:03.510
<i>Did I really</i>

00:02:04.400 --> 00:02:06.830
<i>kiss such a man?</i>

00:02:08.340 --> 00:02:12.200
<i>But I only remembered him recently.</i>

00:02:13.540 --> 00:02:17.650
<i>Am I so featherbrained that I'd forget</i>

00:02:17.650 --> 00:02:21.530
<i>something as important as my first kiss?!</i>

00:02:27.990 --> 00:02:29.790
<i>It's that girl again...</i>

00:02:30.300 --> 00:02:32.670
<i>How did she get inside?</i>

00:02:40.080 --> 00:02:41.500
<i>Who is she?</i>

00:02:47.170 --> 00:02:47.980
Hello.

00:02:52.140 --> 00:02:53.960
<i>My name is Shiori Shiomiya.</i>

00:02:53.960 --> 00:02:58.150
<i>Currently, I am possessed by some 
immense, unknown beast.</i>

00:02:59.660 --> 00:03:01.160
<i>Oh, god of romantic encounters,</i>

00:03:01.840 --> 00:03:04.130
<i>you should go and die!</i>

00:04:37.140 --> 00:04:39.960
<i>I let that pervert cause me all that anguish...</i>

00:04:40.420 --> 00:04:44.160
<i>And I even asked him to critique my novel?</i>

00:04:44.650 --> 00:04:46.370
<i>I want nothing more to do with him.</i>

00:04:46.760 --> 00:04:47.970
Excuse me.

00:04:48.790 --> 00:04:51.720
I'm here to read your story.

00:04:53.250 --> 00:04:55.520
<i>H-He remembered?</i>

00:04:56.210 --> 00:04:57.390
<i>No, wait...</i>

00:04:57.390 --> 00:05:00.610
<i>He's saying the right things, 
but his clothes ruin everything!</i>

00:05:01.370 --> 00:05:02.110
<i>Still...</i>

00:05:02.720 --> 00:05:04.860
<i>I should hear what he has to say.</i>

00:05:05.100 --> 00:05:07.040
<i>I am an open-minded person!</i>

00:05:13.420 --> 00:05:16.930
D-Do you enjoy dressing like a girl?

00:05:18.080 --> 00:05:19.130
You see...

00:05:19.540 --> 00:05:22.960
I was in a situation that called 
for me to dress like a girl.

00:05:22.960 --> 00:05:25.340
At first, I did it as part of a plan.

00:05:25.340 --> 00:05:27.380
But then, I couldn't stop.

00:05:27.770 --> 00:05:31.630
In hindsight, my life began to fall apart the day

00:05:31.630 --> 00:05:34.360
a servant of Hell appeared 
before me on the roof.

00:05:34.360 --> 00:05:36.980
The line between rationality 
and irrationality is long gone.

00:05:37.510 --> 00:05:42.650
Am I doomed to be ground to 
dust upon the wheel of reality?

00:05:44.930 --> 00:05:47.400
<i>What is he saying?</i>

00:05:48.260 --> 00:05:51.090
<i>I don't understand what he's talking about...</i>

00:05:51.480 --> 00:05:53.820
<i>What's wrong with him?</i>

00:05:56.920 --> 00:05:58.690
Sorry to bore you with my story.

00:05:58.690 --> 00:05:59.880
I'm leaving.

00:06:01.510 --> 00:06:02.620
Wait!

00:06:03.730 --> 00:06:07.020
According to 1,347 of the books in this library,

00:06:07.410 --> 00:06:11.850
if you talk to someone about your 
troubles, you'll feel better.

00:06:12.620 --> 00:06:15.520
Please tell me more about yourself.

00:06:21.750 --> 00:06:23.360
Can it be while we walk home?

00:06:23.620 --> 00:06:27.360
Wh-While we walk home?!

00:06:32.270 --> 00:06:33.680
<i>He wears a wig</i>

00:06:34.510 --> 00:06:36.350
<i>when he's outside...</i>

00:06:38.310 --> 00:06:40.510
With this, most don't notice I'm not a girl.

00:06:43.670 --> 00:06:46.010
<i>He's pretty cute.</i>

00:06:47.470 --> 00:06:49.760
U-Um, let's find a place

00:06:50.060 --> 00:06:51.300
to talk inside.

00:06:52.340 --> 00:06:54.140
We can talk as we walk.

00:06:54.570 --> 00:06:55.410
But...

00:06:55.410 --> 00:06:56.890
L-Let's...

00:06:56.890 --> 00:06:59.140
Let's go in there!

00:06:59.140 --> 00:07:01.650
<b>Ramen Fuurin</b>

00:07:00.120 --> 00:07:01.650
Ramen?

00:07:02.120 --> 00:07:03.400
Welcome!

00:07:04.020 --> 00:07:08.000
<i>I never had the courage to order anything in 
these places where they shout out greetings.</i>

00:07:08.450 --> 00:07:11.110
<i>But right now, I'm with a boy...</i>

00:07:11.110 --> 00:07:13.580
<i>Maybe I can finally order that negi ramen!</i>

00:07:14.320 --> 00:07:16.200
What are you getting?

00:07:15.530 --> 00:07:17.330
<b>Ticket</b>

00:07:19.300 --> 00:07:22.710
<i>There's a system that lets you order 
food without saying a word...</i>

00:07:26.460 --> 00:07:28.070
<i>D-Delicious!</i>

00:07:28.070 --> 00:07:29.340
<i>I'm so glad I'm alive!</i>

00:07:31.190 --> 00:07:35.450
<i>But this means my first meal with a boy is ramen.</i>

00:07:35.450 --> 00:07:38.780
<i>Does this make me a disgrace to young girls?</i>

00:07:38.780 --> 00:07:42.620
<i>But he's cross-dressing, which is 
surely a disgrace to all boys...</i>

00:07:46.320 --> 00:07:50.460
<i>There wasn't anyone like him in the books I read.</i>

00:07:55.540 --> 00:07:56.950
U-Um...

00:07:57.290 --> 00:07:58.550
Would it be okay

00:08:00.060 --> 00:08:02.710
if I wrote a story with you as the protagonist?

00:08:04.080 --> 00:08:05.380
I...

00:08:05.720 --> 00:08:08.300
I want to write a story about you!

00:08:09.470 --> 00:08:11.220
S-Sure...

00:08:11.580 --> 00:08:13.560
Th-Thank you very much!

00:08:14.700 --> 00:08:17.310
Please come to the library tomorrow morning.

00:08:17.310 --> 00:08:18.720
I'll have something to show you!

00:08:19.830 --> 00:08:22.230
<i>I feel like, right now, I can write!</i>

00:08:22.830 --> 00:08:24.230
Thanks for coming!

00:08:25.090 --> 00:08:27.300
She should finish her story in time 
for the Mai High Festival.

00:08:27.770 --> 00:08:28.980
Really?

00:08:28.980 --> 00:08:30.990
Yes, she should be fine.

00:08:31.670 --> 00:08:36.310
Shiori has trouble finishing stories because 
she lacks confidence in her material.

00:08:36.310 --> 00:08:38.300
That's why she loses interest before she can finish.

00:08:39.000 --> 00:08:42.120
But now, she's acquainted with 
a very unique person.

00:08:42.740 --> 00:08:45.110
There's no better material to work with!

00:08:45.110 --> 00:08:46.380
You shouldn't say that.

00:08:46.750 --> 00:08:51.380
Once she finishes her novel, 
Shiori's affection level will be maxed.

00:08:53.090 --> 00:08:55.000
Finally, I can see the ending!

00:08:55.420 --> 00:08:56.370
It's been a while.

00:08:56.370 --> 00:08:57.890
I couldn't care less.

00:08:59.330 --> 00:09:01.270
<b>Goddess Search, Day 7</b>

00:09:03.290 --> 00:09:04.500
U-Um...

00:09:07.590 --> 00:09:10.150
I'm almost done.

00:09:10.530 --> 00:09:12.550
You haven't written a single word!

00:09:12.550 --> 00:09:15.720
What are you trying to do, maestro?!

00:09:19.270 --> 00:09:20.750
U-Um...

00:09:20.750 --> 00:09:23.200
I could finish it with another hour...

00:09:23.200 --> 00:09:25.220
What could you possibly 
accomplish in one hour?

00:09:25.220 --> 00:09:27.440
How short is this novel?!

00:09:27.870 --> 00:09:30.670
<i>However, there are signs that 
she's trashed multiple drafts.</i>

00:09:31.360 --> 00:09:32.240
Shiori...

00:09:32.240 --> 00:09:33.880
<i>He used my first name?</i>

00:09:34.130 --> 00:09:36.550
The two of us will spend all day in here.

00:09:37.240 --> 00:09:40.490
I'm not leaving until you finish your story.

00:09:40.490 --> 00:09:41.850
And I won't let you leave.

00:09:42.260 --> 00:09:42.780
Huh?

00:09:42.780 --> 00:09:44.690
You must finish your novel by tomorrow.

00:09:44.690 --> 00:09:45.310
Got it?

00:09:45.310 --> 00:09:48.350
Eh?

00:09:49.690 --> 00:09:53.440
Shiori has a vast imagination that she 
can escape to whenever she wants.

00:09:49.940 --> 00:09:54.860
<b>Library Closed Today</b>

00:09:53.440 --> 00:09:54.860
So I must keep her on her toes.

00:09:55.340 --> 00:09:58.270
But if I push too hard, 
she'll feel time is running out.

00:09:58.270 --> 00:10:00.590
In other words, she may try to escape.

00:10:00.590 --> 00:10:02.640
That's why I'm locking her up here.

00:10:02.640 --> 00:10:04.560
But it's due tomorrow...

00:10:04.560 --> 00:10:06.780
Will it be enough to help her finish in time?

00:10:07.190 --> 00:10:09.720
My only option is to help her write a masterpiece.

00:10:09.720 --> 00:10:11.480
Isn't this her first novel?

00:10:11.480 --> 00:10:12.880
You make it sound easy.

00:10:13.150 --> 00:10:16.190
I don't foresee any other scenarios for her.

00:10:16.190 --> 00:10:17.690
Well, good luck...

00:10:17.690 --> 00:10:19.620
I'm going out for a bit.

00:10:19.620 --> 00:10:20.640
Where?

00:10:21.330 --> 00:10:24.040
Section chiefs have to attend 
briefing meetings regularly.

00:10:24.310 --> 00:10:25.180
Oh.

00:10:27.160 --> 00:10:28.140
What's wrong?

00:10:28.780 --> 00:10:32.060
The past two days, I dressed as a girl.

00:10:32.540 --> 00:10:35.360
I'm not used to exposing my legs to the cold.

00:10:35.360 --> 00:10:36.570
You should watch your health.

00:10:36.970 --> 00:10:39.260
You're probably pretty exhausted, too,

00:10:39.260 --> 00:10:40.510
so don't overdo it.

00:10:41.520 --> 00:10:44.450
If none of you had come, 
I wouldn't have to deal with this.

00:10:47.890 --> 00:10:49.470
Are you a child?

00:10:51.060 --> 00:10:52.650
<i>Have you heard the rumors about</i>

00:10:52.650 --> 00:10:56.430
<i>Vintage worming their way
 into the Loose Souls Team?</i>

00:10:56.920 --> 00:10:58.140
I must see if it's true.

00:10:59.470 --> 00:11:00.430
<i>Why...</i>

00:11:02.340 --> 00:11:04.430
<i>Why is this happening?</i>

00:11:12.400 --> 00:11:13.650
<b>I am a cross-dressing boy. 
My name is Katsuragi.</b>

00:11:15.250 --> 00:11:17.130
<i>This is my debut work!</i>

00:11:17.130 --> 00:11:19.580
<i>Imitating other works right from 
the intro is out of the question!</i>

00:11:20.720 --> 00:11:24.520
<i>I need an introduction that's 
original and interesting.</i>

00:11:27.220 --> 00:11:30.160
<i>"Stardate 10 RD 10.</i>

00:11:30.160 --> 00:11:36.250
<i>The centripetal force holding the planets in 
the once-powerful Galactic Alliance together</i>

00:11:36.250 --> 00:11:38.990
<i>rapidly weakened, leading to its complete fall.</i>

00:11:39.450 --> 00:11:41.720
<i>Which threw the galaxy into total war!"</i>

00:11:43.040 --> 00:11:47.510
<i>When I'm stuck, I have a bad habit 
of falling back on galactic wars...</i>

00:11:47.880 --> 00:11:49.850
<i>The galaxy should be at peace.</i>

00:11:50.680 --> 00:11:52.350
<i>I should focus on the characters.</i>

00:11:52.590 --> 00:11:55.860
<i>With standout characters, how I 
start the story won't matter.</i>

00:11:55.860 --> 00:11:57.110
<b>Keima Katsuragi</b>

00:11:59.650 --> 00:12:03.520
<i>I just realized that I know nothing about him.</i>

00:12:03.860 --> 00:12:05.410
<i>What I do know is that...</i>

00:12:05.790 --> 00:12:07.530
<i>He's rumored to be involved with a celebrity...</i>

00:12:07.530 --> 00:12:10.540
<i>And he's a cross-dresser in a relationship with a boy.</i>

00:12:10.540 --> 00:12:12.870
<i>He defies common sense!</i>

00:12:13.770 --> 00:12:17.310
<i>Is it possible that I imagined everything?</i>

00:12:17.310 --> 00:12:19.190
<i>Including the kiss?</i>

00:12:19.190 --> 00:12:20.130
<i>But...</i>

00:12:20.580 --> 00:12:24.790
<i>I can't just ask, "Did you kiss me?"</i>

00:12:26.850 --> 00:12:29.460
<i>Wh-What am I thinking?</i>

00:12:29.460 --> 00:12:31.810
<i>I must write! Write quickly!</i>

00:12:32.220 --> 00:12:35.410
<i>This is when I should refer to 
my predecessors' works.</i>

00:12:35.410 --> 00:12:37.690
<i>There must be a hint somewhere!</i>

00:12:42.220 --> 00:12:44.150
<i>Ah, I got too engrossed in the book...</i>

00:12:44.410 --> 00:12:46.160
<i>An hour and a half has passed!</i>

00:12:46.480 --> 00:12:48.380
<i>I succumbed to temptation.</i>

00:12:48.380 --> 00:12:50.610
<i>Focus on writing... Focus!</i>

00:12:51.450 --> 00:12:53.160
<i>If I write "cross-dressing" in English...</i>

00:12:57.810 --> 00:13:01.230
What am I doing?! I'm such an idiot!

00:13:06.740 --> 00:13:09.470
<i>I guess it's okay if I can't write anything today.</i>

00:13:10.460 --> 00:13:12.780
<i>Since I can't think of any ideas.</i>

00:13:13.230 --> 00:13:17.110
<i>Under these circumstances, it's impossible 
to have a miraculous flash of inspiration.</i>

00:13:18.860 --> 00:13:21.400
Stop thinking, and start writing.

00:13:22.680 --> 00:13:23.400
<i>Huh?</i>

00:13:24.920 --> 00:13:26.030
<i>What?</i>

00:13:26.350 --> 00:13:29.180
You have one day left before the deadline...

00:13:29.920 --> 00:13:31.990
But you haven't written a single page.

00:13:32.740 --> 00:13:36.040
Why do you read so many books?

00:13:36.040 --> 00:13:39.190
You should stop thinking, and start writing.

00:13:39.190 --> 00:13:40.550
<i>Quiet...</i>

00:13:41.480 --> 00:13:45.450
It's your fault, for not taking any action!

00:13:45.450 --> 00:13:48.260
You're supposed to be a character in my story!

00:13:48.620 --> 00:13:51.070
So it's my fault?

00:13:51.070 --> 00:13:53.390
Isn't it the writer's fault?

00:13:54.090 --> 00:13:55.150
Shut up!

00:13:55.150 --> 00:13:56.310
I'll bury you!

00:13:57.610 --> 00:14:01.190
Weren't you the one who wanted to write a novel?

00:14:03.410 --> 00:14:05.680
<i>You've changed, Shiori.</i>

00:14:05.680 --> 00:14:06.200
<i>Huh?</i>

00:14:06.450 --> 00:14:09.950
<i>You still don't talk much, 
but you're more cheerful.</i>

00:14:10.270 --> 00:14:11.990
You've changed, Shiori.

00:14:12.430 --> 00:14:15.910
Weren't you only interested 
in reading books before?

00:14:16.180 --> 00:14:20.380
Who did you hope would read a novel you wrote?

00:14:20.440 --> 00:14:23.910
<b>Shiori</b>

00:14:22.470 --> 00:14:24.520
<i>I'm not doing this for other people.</i>

00:14:25.240 --> 00:14:29.500
<i>I just wanted to do something 
about these pent-up feelings.</i>

00:14:31.300 --> 00:14:34.590
<i>Ever since that moment, 
my heart hasn't stopped racing.</i>

00:14:34.590 --> 00:14:36.810
<i>I had to do something before my heart...</i>

00:14:37.070 --> 00:14:40.190
<i>Before my entire body burst!</i>

00:14:40.190 --> 00:14:42.720
<i>I had to do something!</i>

00:14:46.480 --> 00:14:49.820
<i>But I've only added to my pent-up feelings.</i>

00:14:50.410 --> 00:14:53.780
<i>I thought I had the ability to write stories,</i>

00:14:53.780 --> 00:14:55.490
<i>but it seems I was wrong.</i>

00:14:56.590 --> 00:14:59.290
Stop thinking, and start writing.

00:15:02.110 --> 00:15:03.560
Just write.

00:15:03.560 --> 00:15:07.090
You have what it takes to write the best stories.

00:15:09.400 --> 00:15:10.920
<i>You make it sound so easy.</i>

00:15:10.920 --> 00:15:12.050
It is easy.

00:15:13.060 --> 00:15:15.060
Just write about yourself.

00:15:16.780 --> 00:15:19.220
There are many different stories in the world.

00:15:19.220 --> 00:15:21.080
But none of them matter.

00:15:22.050 --> 00:15:25.190
I want to read a story about you.

00:15:26.100 --> 00:15:30.320
A story about a girl who loves 
books and lives in a library.

00:15:31.060 --> 00:15:34.580
But she has trouble talking to people 
and seals herself in the library.

00:15:36.490 --> 00:15:38.500
That's the story I want to read.

00:15:39.250 --> 00:15:40.000
It...

00:15:40.930 --> 00:15:43.500
It wouldn't be interesting!

00:15:47.830 --> 00:15:51.030
Shiori can write that story if she 
remembers what happened.

00:15:55.090 --> 00:15:57.970
<i>It's true... He was there!</i>

00:15:58.340 --> 00:16:01.060
<i>That night, when I holed myself up here...</i>

00:16:03.910 --> 00:16:05.190
<i>He was with me!</i>

00:16:14.160 --> 00:16:15.870
Are you ready to write now?

00:16:27.370 --> 00:16:28.290
Huh?

00:16:31.080 --> 00:16:33.800
K-Katsuragi!

00:17:24.560 --> 00:17:28.060
<b>My Story.</b>

00:17:26.570 --> 00:17:28.060
<i>"My Story."</i>

00:17:29.350 --> 00:17:33.220
The Chief's Key and the King's Treasure 
in the Valley <i>was very good.</i>

00:17:33.940 --> 00:17:37.300
Endless Adventure <i>was good, as well.</i>

00:17:37.700 --> 00:17:41.450
Modern Map of Philosophy 2 
<i>was even better than the first one.</i>

00:17:41.710 --> 00:17:45.710
Culture Lessons: Breakdancing 
Is Easy! <i>wasn't very easy.</i>

00:17:53.630 --> 00:17:56.690
<i>These are all the books I've read this week.</i>

00:17:57.460 --> 00:18:00.200
<i>As a library committee member, 
I get to read a lot.</i>

00:18:00.820 --> 00:18:03.280
<i>Books that are interesting, and books that aren't.</i>

00:18:03.280 --> 00:18:05.730
<i>Books that are fun, and books that are sad.</i>

00:18:05.730 --> 00:18:06.970
<i>Books that are pleasant,</i>

00:18:06.970 --> 00:18:09.230
<i>and books I want to read again tomorrow.</i>

00:18:10.360 --> 00:18:12.950
<i>I enjoy reading popular books.</i>

00:18:12.950 --> 00:18:16.270
<i>After all, books are meant to be read.</i>

00:18:16.880 --> 00:18:20.000
<i>I take special care to read books 
that aren't popular, too.</i>

00:18:20.460 --> 00:18:22.990
<i>Every book is interesting in its own way.</i>

00:18:23.780 --> 00:18:25.400
<i>I like books in good condition.</i>

00:18:25.400 --> 00:18:27.600
<i>It makes me happy to look at them.</i>

00:18:28.610 --> 00:18:30.420
<i>I like books that are worn.</i>

00:18:30.420 --> 00:18:32.250
<i>It shows that they did their job well.</i>

00:18:33.650 --> 00:18:38.190
<i>All of these books live in one 
large house, the library.</i>

00:18:38.190 --> 00:18:40.460
<i>It is my happy place.</i>

00:18:40.460 --> 00:18:44.530
<i>A place where many different people's wisdom,
many different people's experience,</i>

00:18:44.530 --> 00:18:48.800
<i>and many different people's thoughts come together.</i>

00:18:48.800 --> 00:18:51.070
<i>There's nowhere else like it.</i>

00:18:51.480 --> 00:18:54.320
<i>But I do have friends.</i>

00:18:56.160 --> 00:18:58.490
<i>Committee Chairman Fujiidera.</i>

00:18:58.490 --> 00:19:02.030
<i>She's always yelling at people, 
but she's very nice.</i>

00:19:02.380 --> 00:19:06.430
<i>She didn't tell the teachers when 
I locked myself in the library.</i>

00:19:06.430 --> 00:19:07.780
<i>I'll never forget that.</i>

00:19:09.080 --> 00:19:11.760
<i>Miwa is an underclassman who likes music.</i>

00:19:11.760 --> 00:19:13.890
<i>She always has lots to tell me.</i>

00:19:13.890 --> 00:19:16.850
<i>But when she invites me to scary places</i>

00:19:16.850 --> 00:19:19.260
<i>like karaoke bars, I have to decline.</i>

00:19:19.760 --> 00:19:23.310
<i>Kamii is a movie buff with a crush on Miwa.</i>

00:19:23.310 --> 00:19:27.260
<i>But he should read books, 
as he's on the library committee.</i>

00:19:28.850 --> 00:19:32.140
<i>I've started to enjoy reading outside.</i>

00:19:32.140 --> 00:19:34.560
<i>I don't mind when the library is crowded, either.</i>

00:19:34.560 --> 00:19:35.880
<i>I understand it now.</i>

00:19:35.880 --> 00:19:39.810
<i>Because books are written by people, 
for other people to read.</i>

00:19:39.810 --> 00:19:41.700
<i>Books are like my air.</i>

00:19:41.700 --> 00:19:45.400
<i>As long as I have books, my world is endless.</i>

00:19:46.170 --> 00:19:48.370
<i>And I...</i>

00:19:49.980 --> 00:19:52.690
<b>And I</b>

00:19:52.690 --> 00:19:56.590
<b>love Katsuragi.</b>

00:20:09.300 --> 00:20:11.100
H-Huh?

00:20:11.780 --> 00:20:13.350
Are you a goddess?

00:20:13.630 --> 00:20:14.310
Eh?

00:20:15.560 --> 00:20:19.540
Apollo said that I shouldn't talk to strangers!

00:20:19.540 --> 00:20:20.360
Apollo?

00:20:24.670 --> 00:20:26.370
Ow...

00:20:29.470 --> 00:20:31.610
K-Katsuragi...

00:20:32.730 --> 00:20:34.500
Looks like you finished it.

00:20:35.850 --> 00:20:38.400
I was just jotting down my thoughts.

00:20:38.400 --> 00:20:40.510
It wasn't a story...

00:20:42.040 --> 00:20:45.760
I think it's your best one so far.

00:20:46.360 --> 00:20:48.520
It's the story that only you could write.

00:20:50.620 --> 00:20:51.840
U-Um...

00:20:51.840 --> 00:20:53.240
D-Did you read it?

00:20:54.370 --> 00:20:55.500
All the way to the end?

00:20:57.080 --> 00:20:59.110
Don't read it!

00:21:03.200 --> 00:21:04.950
U-Um...

00:21:04.950 --> 00:21:06.910
I didn't mean what I said at the end.

00:21:07.370 --> 00:21:10.850
I just had the feeling that 
you weren't coming back...

00:21:16.070 --> 00:21:19.400
Our story isn't over yet.

00:21:26.390 --> 00:21:27.360
Shiori...

00:21:27.360 --> 00:21:29.050
Y-Yes?

00:21:29.410 --> 00:21:31.320
I want you to take this.

00:21:32.330 --> 00:21:34.440
<i>A-A present?</i>

00:21:35.040 --> 00:21:36.610
I want you to wear it.

00:21:37.040 --> 00:21:39.710
I-I can do that...

00:21:39.710 --> 00:21:40.940
Um...

00:21:41.360 --> 00:21:43.960
<i>You read what I wrote at the very end, right?</i>

00:21:43.960 --> 00:21:46.020
<i>Was that kiss your answer?</i>

00:21:46.020 --> 00:21:48.330
Can I come here to see you every day?

00:21:49.680 --> 00:21:52.450
I want to see you every day.

00:21:57.360 --> 00:21:59.460
<i>I couldn't say a word.</i>

00:22:00.720 --> 00:22:04.010
<i>I'm guessing that I won't ever be able</i>

00:22:04.010 --> 00:22:06.990
<i>to speak my mind at will.</i>

00:22:10.970 --> 00:22:13.590
I-I'm Minerva.

00:22:15.480 --> 00:22:19.880
<i>I won't ever be able to talk to people 
about strange stuff like this happening.</i>

00:22:21.000 --> 00:22:25.320
<i>But today, I think I finally found my voice.</i>

00:22:29.990 --> 00:22:31.530
<i>I must write the rest of my story!</i>

00:22:31.870 --> 00:22:34.900
<b>My Story.</b>

00:24:05.920 --> 00:24:07.190
Fever, chills, coughing...

00:24:07.190 --> 00:24:09.170
This was the worst time for a cold!

00:24:09.170 --> 00:24:12.280
But a skilled player can turn any 
disadvantage to an advantage.

00:24:12.280 --> 00:24:15.430
I'll land Ayumi and Chihiro 
with the visit event!

00:24:15.430 --> 00:24:16.720
Sounds rough...

00:24:16.720 --> 00:24:20.020
Since I've never been sick, 
I wouldn't know how it feels.
